params.notes:
{{Effect at cast time start}}
* {{ai|Daisy!|Ivern|Daisy}} dashes to rooted {{tip|monster|monsters}}, and enemy [[champion]]s if within {{tt|1200 units|Estimated}} when ''Rootcaller'' hits.
** She does not dash to enemy [[minion]]s.{{bug|2}}
** {{ai|Daisy!|Ivern|Daisy}} can not dash if she is more than {{tt|1200 units|Estimated}} from the target hit. She will not dash even if she later walks in range.{{bug}}
** Regardless of {{ai|Daisy!|Ivern|Daisy's}} and '''Ivern's''' distance from the target hit, '''Ivern''' dashing does not affect {{ai|Daisy!|Ivern|Daisy}} in any way.{{bug}}
* ''Rootcaller'' will hit {{tip|monster|monsters}} but does not deal damage to it unless the target is an epic monster.
* '''Ivern's''' pull/attack range is determined when he dashes to the target - not from when he initially casts ''Rootcaller'' and throws the vine.
* When using an attack order to dash to a target further than 475 units, '''Ivern''' may stop at his attack range ({{ccd|Ivern|range}} units).
** If he is closer than his attack range from them, '''Ivern''' will dash to {{tt|425 units|Estimated}} away from it instead.
*** Attack range bonuses affect the offset from the target at a 1:1 ratio.
*** '''Ivern''' will never dash closer than his current distance from the target in this case.
* ''Rootcaller's'' {{tip|dash}} is disabled while the user is {{tip|ground|grounded}} or {{tip|root|rooted}} when targeting via either means (applies to '''Ivern''' and his allies).
* ''Rootcaller's'' dash does not follow targets, their position at the time of starting the dash is the relative range '''Ivern''' and his allies will stop at.
